# Safety instructions Cloudflare Pages sends with every page.
# - Strict-Transport-Security: browsers always use the secure https address.
# - X-Frame-Options / frame-ancestors: other sites can't show these pages inside theirs.
# - Permissions-Policy: pages never ask for the camera, microphone or location.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
